- [Spring Profiles](/learning/spring-boot-tutorial/spring-profiles): use H2 in development and MySQL in production.
- [Docker for Spring Boot](/learning/spring-boot-tutorial/docker-for-spring-boot): run MySQL and your app in containers.$sb38$)),
